      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# 引言\n",
        "\n",
        "## 本章讲什么\n",
        "\n",
        "书里第 1 章对比了频率学派和贝叶斯学派的基本立场。用我自己的框架重新表述一遍：\n",
        "\n",
        "- **频率学派**：$\\theta$ 固定未知常数，Q3（先验）不存在，Q5（长期频率覆盖率）是立身之本\n",
        "- **贝叶斯学派**：$\\theta$ 本身是随机变量，Q3 显式建模为 $p(\\theta\\mid\\phi)$\n",
        "\n",
        "## 一个直观例子\n",
        "\n",
        "抛硬币估计正面概率 $\\theta$：\n"
      ],
      "id": "13225c67"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| label: fig-coin\n",
        "#| fig-cap: 频率学派 vs 贝叶斯学派对同一份数据的处理方式\n",
        "#| eval: false\n",
        "\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "from scipy.stats import beta\n",
        "\n",
        "# 观测数据：抛10次，7次正面\n",
        "n, k = 10, 7\n",
        "\n",
        "# 频率学派：点估计 = k/n，不产出分布\n",
        "theta_mle = k / n\n",
        "\n",
        "# 贝叶斯学派：先验 Beta(1,1)，后验 Beta(1+k, 1+n-k)\n",
        "theta_grid = np.linspace(0, 1, 300)\n",
        "prior = beta.pdf(theta_grid, 1, 1)\n",
        "posterior = beta.pdf(theta_grid, 1 + k, 1 + n - k)\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(6, 4))\n",
        "ax.plot(theta_grid, prior, \"--\", color=\"#6C757D\", label=\"先验 Beta(1,1)\")\n",
        "ax.plot(theta_grid, posterior, color=\"#1D3557\", label=\"后验 Beta(8,4)\")\n",
        "ax.axvline(theta_mle, color=\"#B5432B\", linestyle=\":\", label=f\"频率学派 MLE = {theta_mle:.2f}\")\n",
        "ax.set_xlabel(r\"$\\theta$\")\n",
        "ax.set_ylabel(\"密度\")\n",
        "ax.legend()\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "fig-coin",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "频率学派只给你一个点（MLE = 0.7），贝叶斯学派给你一整条后验分布——这条分布的形状本身就编码了\"你对 $\\theta$ 有多不确定\"。"
      ],
      "id": "cefbe5bd"
    }
  ],
